# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Smart Kulkas — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Copy this file to `.env` (it is gitignored — never committed).
# 2. Fill in your own keys. Real key values never go in this file.
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY NOTE — please read:
# Variables prefixed with `EXPO_PUBLIC_` are inlined into the app
# bundle at build time. Anyone with the built app (or APK) can
# extract them. This is fine for a personal app, but treat these
# values as *public*, not secrets. If you need real secrecy, route
# AI calls through a small proxy server instead.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED — Google Gemini API key.
# Powers AI category prediction, recipe suggestions, and waste-reduction tips.
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL — OpenRouter API key.
# Used as a fallback when Gemini is unavailable or hits its quota.
# Get a key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# You can leave this empty if you only use Gemini.
EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
